# WARP-8's generators. A lane held on a kit's grid: the knobs shape it (ui.c lane_knob). The Generate page, SEQ's
# third on a kit: the grid shows what the generator would write, the knobs are its settings, SEL writes it, as one
# undo (pages.c gen_result, ui.c gen_knob, gen_write)
wait 300
listen
expect trk 1
tap SEQ
expect page Steps
# a lane held (key 6, empty): knob 1 its hits, spread evenly (none: cleared); knob 2 turns it a step
key b5 down
wait 100
turn K1 4
wait 40
expect note 1 1 1 6
expect note 1 1 5 6
expect note 1 1 9 6
expect note 1 1 13 6
expect note 1 1 2 0
turn K2 1
wait 40
expect note 1 1 1 0
expect note 1 1 2 6
expect note 1 1 14 6
turn K1 -4
wait 40
expect note 1 1 2 0
expect note 1 1 14 0
key b5 up
wait 40
# Generate: EUCLID, four hits, on the lane shown (the kick's)
tapkey b0
turn SELECT 2
wait 40
expect page Generate
tap SEL
wait 40
said WRITTEN
expect note 1 1 1 1
expect note 1 1 5 1
expect note 1 1 9 1
expect note 1 1 13 1
expect note 1 1 2 0
# five hits, turned two steps later: 3, 7, 10, 13, 16
turn K1 1
turn K2 2
wait 40
tap SEL
wait 40
expect note 1 1 1 0
expect note 1 1 3 1
expect note 1 1 7 1
expect note 1 1 10 1
expect note 1 1 13 1
expect note 1 1 16 1
# undo: the four on the beats again
press HOME
tap REC
release HOME
wait 40
expect note 1 1 1 1
expect note 1 1 3 0
# MODE add: the five join the four
turn K3 1
wait 40
tap SEL
wait 40
expect note 1 1 1 1
expect note 1 1 3 1
expect note 1 1 5 1
expect note 1 1 7 1
# MUTATE at 100 %: the hits on the beats stay
turn K4 1
wait 40
said GENERATOR
turn K1 14
wait 40
tap SEL
wait 40
expect note 1 1 1 1
expect note 1 1 5 1
expect note 1 1 9 1
expect note 1 1 13 1
# GRIDS at the map's middle, half full: a kick on the one
turn K4 1
wait 40
shot generate_grids.png
tap SEL
wait 40
said WRITTEN
expect note 1 1 1 1
# a melodic track has no Generate page: SEQ's pages are Steps and Bar
knob 2 engine 6
wait 40
press HOME
turn ALGO 1
release HOME
wait 40
expect trk 2
expect page Steps
